<title>USA: Amarillo feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Amarillo feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Early sales feeder steers and heifers under 700 lbs steady, heavier weights not established, compared to last week, USDA said.</p>
<p>Trade was active and demand good.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 - 600-700 lbs</p>
<p>68.00-74.50. Medium and Large 1-2 - 600-700 lbs 67.25-68.00.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 - few 600-700 lbs</p>
<p>64.75-65.75. Medium and Large 1-2 - few 600-715 lbs</p>
<p>59.50-63.50.</p>
<p>Receipts - 8,500</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
